<title>BELGIUM: EU clears joint buy of Bayer's corundun business.</title>
<headline>EU clears joint buy of Bayer's corundun business.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said it has cleared the joint acquisition of HC Stark, a Bayer subsidiary which is active in the field of corundum, a material used in the making of abrasives.</p>
</text>
